  "result": "Perfect! \u2705 All 402 tests pass (38 new currency tests + 30 export + 17 late fee + 20 VAT summary + 24 overdue + 273 existing).\n\n**`src/money.js` updated with foreign currency support:**\n\n**New constants and functions:**\n- `RATES` constant: `{ EUR: 1, USD: 1.085, GBP: 0.8425 }`\n- `convert(cents, currency)` \u2014 Converts euro cents to target currency, returns `ok(amount)` or `fail('UNKNOWN_CURRENCY')`\n- `formatMoney(cents, currency)` \u2014 Formats currency amounts with appropriate symbol and thousands separators\n\n**Conversion behavior:**\n- Formula: `roundCents(eurocents \u00d7 RATES[currency])`\n- Uses banker's rounding for precision\n- Supports EUR, USD, GBP (case-sensitive)\n- Returns fail result for unknown currencies\n\n**Formatting:**\n- EUR: `\u20ac1,234.56` format\n- USD: `$1,234.56` format\n- GBP: `\u00a31,234.56` format\n- Always 2 decimal places\n- Thousands separators for values \u2265 1000\n- Negative amounts: `-$100.50`\n\n**Test coverage (38 new tests):**\n- RATES constant accuracy\n- Convert functionality (EUR\u2194USD, EUR\u2194GBP, invalid currencies)\n- Rounding correctness (banker's rounding applied)\n- Zero and negative amounts\n- Large amount conversions\n- formatMoney currency symbols\n- Thousands separator formatting\n- Two decimal place precision\n- Integration tests (convert + format workflow)\n- Case sensitivity verification\n- Error handling for unknown currencies\n\nAll invoicing features complete: invoices, payments, terms, vouchers, discounts, VAT, reports (overdue, VAT summary, late fees), CSV export, and now foreign currency support. Ready to ship.",
